sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as CLI / IPC Client
    participant IPC as graph.* handler
    participant GV as GraphValidator
    participant GR as GraphRuntime
    participant PM as PersistenceManager
    participant LE as LinkEngine
    participant YAML as system.yaml

    Client->>IPC: graph.links.add {id, from, to, bind}
    IPC->>GV: validate(diff)
    alt invalid
        GV-->>Client: graph.validate errors
    else valid
        GV->>GR: apply(diff)
        GR->>LE: register link
        GR->>PM: write_atomic(yaml)
        PM->>YAML: rename tmp → system.yaml
        alt VPN already connected
            LE->>LE: propagate binding immediately
        end
        GR-->>Client: success + graph.status
    end
